    "## 1.3 Create a notebook to plot sinusoidal signals (final version).\n",
    "\n",
    "We now create a function `sinusoid` that generates sinusoidal signals.  \n",
    "This allows code reusability and clarity.  \n",
    "We also improve variable names, add comments (why, not what), and docstrings.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 42,
   "id": "2b008118",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 800x400 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
